<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Mangalore port on December 13:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Urea		   1,387 (ULD) 27,480    Pratistha	 10/12</p>
<p>Sugar		  2,350 (LDD)  2,340    Sea Horse	 11/12</p>
<p>Timber		 2,763 (ULD) 16,641    Vanda Nari	11/12</p>
<p>Granite Stone	1,015 (LDD)  1,962    White Harkiyo   10/12</p>
<p>Motor Spirit	 6,000 (LDD) 12,000    Vishwa Doot     12/12</p>
<p>Fuel Oil	    10,000 (LDD)    ---    Jag Pragati     11/12</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>ULD-Discharge</p>
<p>LDD-Loading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Mangalore)</p>
